 "_doc": "Which clips each kind of character may use, read by scripts/animation_sets.gd. Kinds come from the registry's gender and age tags (an 'elder' tag makes elder_<gender>). Each pedestrian picks one clip per slot, seeded by its stable ID. 'mx/' clips are in the git-ignored Mixamo library (assets/animations/mixamo_library.res); the others are in the CC0 Quaternius library. Clips missing from the libraries are skipped, and an empty slot falls back to 'fallback'. 'clip_sex' lists the clips only one sex may use. A clip listed twice is picked twice as often.",
